      --policy <POLICY>
          Policy to enforce in the worker pool [default: per_worker] [possible values: per_worker, per_request, oneshot]
--
      --max-parallelism <COUNT>
          Maximum count of workers that can exist in the worker pool simultaneously
=== --max-parallelism 1 (default per_worker policy), 3 distinct functions at once
slow1 200 4.035550s
slow3 200 4.035681s
slow2 200 4.037521s
=== --max-parallelism 1, 5 calls to the same function at once
