slow1#4 200 4.014802s
slow1#1 200 4.016101s
slow1#5 200 4.016089s
slow1#3 200 4.014287s
=== --policy per_request --max-parallelism 1, 3 distinct at once (exploratory)
slow2 200 4.046365s
slow1 200 4.047705s
slow3 200 4.049396s
=== control: no flag
